WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.188
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:04.458 --> 00:05.925
Don't move.

3
00:20.208 --> 00:21.800
Friends.

4
00:23.625 --> 00:25.675
Where are you two from?

5
00:26.502 --> 00:28.041
Just passing through.

6
00:28.041 --> 00:29.966
Who are you?

7
00:33.502 --> 00:35.260
Just the two of you?

8
00:36.765 --> 00:39.750
You look pale, brother.

9
00:39.750 --> 00:41.675
That's a nasty wound.

10
00:46.833 --> 00:49.791
Did something happen?

11
00:49.791 --> 00:51.716
None of your business.

12
00:53.083 --> 00:54.716
Kuan.

13
00:56.583 --> 00:58.083
Sorry.

14
00:58.083 --> 01:00.708
I need to take your temperature.

15
01:00.708 --> 01:02.300
It's just routine procedure.

16
01:22.250 --> 01:23.675
You're clear.

17
01:26.875 --> 01:28.466
Don't be afraid.

18
01:29.083 --> 01:30.958
We're out here...

19
01:30.958 --> 01:34.550
to scavenge for supplies.

20
01:36.518 --> 01:38.418
Our camp is just up there.

21
01:38.418 --> 01:41.593
A fifteen-minute drive away.

22
01:43.416 --> 01:47.083
Want to come back with us and rest up?

23
01:47.083 --> 01:49.041
Thanks for the offer.

24
01:49.041 --> 01:50.550
But no thanks.

25
01:54.625 --> 01:56.425
I won't force you.

26
01:57.625 --> 01:59.750
But if that wound isn't treated soon,

27
01:59.750 --> 02:01.508
it'll definitely get infected.

28
02:04.791 --> 02:06.293
He's right.

29
02:06.293 --> 02:09.345
Your wound really needs to be tended to as soon as possible.

30
02:16.416 --> 02:18.966
Then... sorry for the trouble.

31
02:32.333 --> 02:34.008
We're here.

32
02:40.752 --> 02:42.303
Dao is back!

33
02:42.303 --> 02:44.041
We're back.

34
02:44.041 --> 02:46.166
Open the gate! Dao is back!

35
02:46.166 --> 02:48.083
Unload the goods, boys!

36
02:48.083 --> 02:49.716
Sure thing, Dao.

37
02:54.873 --> 02:56.500
What do you think?

38
02:56.500 --> 03:00.958
This place used to be a film studio.

39
03:00.958 --> 03:03.458
Everyone fled before the apocalypse.

40
03:03.458 --> 03:06.580
We fixed it up and turned it into a base.

41
03:06.580 --> 03:08.871
Dozens of people live here now.

42
03:08.871 --> 03:10.121
- Both elderly and children. - Dao is back!

43
03:10.121 --> 03:11.580
We all look out for one another.

44
03:11.580 --> 03:12.621
Good work, Dao.

45
03:12.621 --> 03:14.213
Good work.

46
03:15.496 --> 03:17.083
Surprised?

47
03:17.083 --> 03:20.496
We all used to work in film.

48
03:20.496 --> 03:24.206
As for me, I used to be a producer.

49
03:24.206 --> 03:25.873
- His name is Xiao Long. - Dao, you're back.

50
03:25.873 --> 03:27.706
He used to be a stuntman.

51
03:27.706 --> 03:30.340
Jiang is a prop master.

52
03:31.540 --> 03:34.623
- Ms. Li, thanks for the hard work. - Hello, Dao.

53
03:34.623 --> 03:37.206
Ms. Li used to be our costume designer.

54
03:37.206 --> 03:39.665
Everyone has their own talents.

55
03:39.665 --> 03:43.506
I didn't expect them to come in handy after the apocalypse.

56
03:44.915 --> 03:46.040
Let me help you.

57
03:46.040 --> 03:48.456
You're back. No need.

58
03:48.456 --> 03:50.165
- It's quite heavy. - Thank you, Dao.

59
03:50.165 --> 03:51.790
You're welcome.

60
03:51.790 --> 03:52.956
I won!

61
03:52.956 --> 03:54.206
Playing mahjong?

62
03:54.206 --> 03:55.415
I'm done.

63
03:55.415 --> 03:57.332
- Having fun? - Dao.

64
03:57.332 --> 03:58.965
We just finished work.

65
03:59.623 --> 04:02.415
We don't keep idlers here.

66
04:02.415 --> 04:04.998
Those who can fight hunt and keep watch.

67
04:04.998 --> 04:07.331
Those who are handy will cook and mend.

68
04:07.331 --> 04:10.081
- Hello, Dao. - Hello.

69
04:10.081 --> 04:11.706
That's our water storage area.

70
04:11.706 --> 04:14.536
The water for laundry and cooking is all here.

71
04:14.536 --> 04:17.536
We also have people who can't do heavy work.

72
04:17.536 --> 04:21.411
They help raise the kids and grow vegetables.

73
04:21.411 --> 04:23.828
We all have to survive.

74
04:23.828 --> 04:25.333
This is the infirmary.

75
04:25.333 --> 04:26.455
Hello, Dao.

76
04:26.455 --> 04:27.913
Feeling better? Remember to change your dressing.

77
04:27.913 --> 04:29.080
All right. Much better now.

78
04:29.080 --> 04:30.871
Xiao Xi.

79
04:30.871 --> 04:33.246
Remember to give this lad some anti-inflammatory medicine.

80
04:33.246 --> 04:34.880
Okay.

81
04:35.621 --> 04:38.705
You two can rest for a few days.

82
04:38.705 --> 04:40.955
If you want to stay here long-term,

83
04:40.955 --> 04:43.788
you have to work like everyone else.

84
04:43.788 --> 04:47.455
After all, the resources here were accumulated little by little.

85
04:47.455 --> 04:49.755
No one can stay here for free.

86
04:53.663 --> 04:54.913
Thank you, Dao.

87
04:54.913 --> 04:56.288
We'll just rest for two days.

88
04:56.288 --> 04:58.080
We won't cause you any trouble.

89
04:58.080 --> 04:59.996
Okay, no problem.

90
04:59.996 --> 05:01.038
Xiao Xi.

91
05:01.038 --> 05:02.788
Help me settle these two lads.

92
05:02.788 --> 05:04.371
Check the storeroom

93
05:04.371 --> 05:06.167
for any daily necessities they might need.

94
05:06.167 --> 05:08.588
- This way, please. - Follow me.

95
05:10.583 --> 05:13.716
Dou Dou, be careful not to fall.

96
05:16.621 --> 05:18.038
That injury looks serious.

97
05:18.038 --> 05:20.917
I'll have Dr. He from our base come take a look later.

98
05:20.917 --> 05:22.190
No need to trouble him.

99
05:22.190 --> 05:25.955
No, that wound needs to be cleaned and disinfected again.

100
05:25.955 --> 05:28.371
Please bring some iodine and gauze later.

101
05:28.371 --> 05:31.913
Sure. Tell Dao if you need anything.

102
05:31.913 --> 05:32.997
Both of these rooms are empty.

103
05:32.997 --> 05:34.830
Take your pick.

104
05:34.830 --> 05:36.580
One room is enough.

105
05:36.580 --> 05:38.580
One room it is, then.

106
05:38.580 --> 05:40.705
I'll have someone bring over bedding and medicine shortly.

107
05:40.705 --> 05:42.463
Okay, thank you.

108
06:48.342 --> 06:53.000
[Apocalypse Log 14]

109
07:11.583 --> 07:12.836
All done.

110
07:13.746 --> 07:15.371
It's lights out.

111
07:15.371 --> 07:17.500
Please return to your rooms.

112
07:17.500 --> 07:18.752
Close your doors and windows.

113
07:18.752 --> 07:20.386
Stay safe.

114
07:21.330 --> 07:23.038
It's lights out.

115
07:23.038 --> 07:24.871
Please return to your rooms.

116
07:24.871 --> 07:26.496
Get some sleep.

117
07:26.496 --> 07:28.130
Stay safe.

118
07:39.621 --> 07:41.213
Good night.

119
07:46.288 --> 07:48.213
Sleep here.

120
07:56.871 --> 07:58.755
Then behave yourself.

121
09:19.788 --> 09:22.088
Behave and go to sleep.

122
09:33.730 --> 09:35.321
Sleep now.

123
10:03.496 --> 10:05.921
- The weather is so nice today. - Lin Zai!

124
10:07.333 --> 10:08.966
Grandma Qiu!

125
10:11.330 --> 10:14.788
Child, you're alive!

126
10:14.788 --> 10:16.080
Grandma...

127
10:16.080 --> 10:17.921
What are you doing here?

128
10:18.788 --> 10:20.380
Lie!

129
10:21.513 --> 10:23.290
What happened to you two?

130
10:23.290 --> 10:26.331
We all thought something had happened.

131
10:26.331 --> 10:29.215
Grandma, it's a long story.

132
10:29.873 --> 10:32.956
Lie and I did go to pick berries that day.

133
10:32.956 --> 10:34.958
But we ran into some trouble on the way.

134
10:34.958 --> 10:35.960
And then?

135
10:35.960 --> 10:37.468
Then...

136
10:38.165 --> 10:39.206
It's all thanks to Lie.

137
10:39.206 --> 10:41.090
He protected me the whole way.

138
10:46.000 --> 10:49.125
Grandma, how did you end up here?

139
10:49.125 --> 10:51.300
Where are Chen Jin and Li Ming?

140
10:53.790 --> 10:57.581
I've only been here for two or three days.

141
10:57.581 --> 11:03.125
After you left, our camp was attacked by zombies.

142
11:03.125 --> 11:06.123
Chen Jin and Li Ming protected me and we ran this way.

143
11:06.123 --> 11:08.040
When we almost reached this camp,

144
11:08.040 --> 11:10.248
we encountered a horde of zombies.

145
11:10.248 --> 11:14.040
They hid me and lured the zombies away.

146
11:14.040 --> 11:16.631
They never came back.

147
11:20.040 --> 11:23.540
Later on, the people from this camp found me

148
11:23.540 --> 11:26.340
and brought me back here.

149
11:27.415 --> 11:29.840
Where did you get separated from them?

150
11:30.623 --> 11:32.331
Not far from here.

151
11:32.331 --> 11:34.290
An abandoned industrial area.

152
11:34.290 --> 11:37.465
Let's borrow a car and look for them.

153
11:38.123 --> 11:39.583
Don't worry, Grandma.

154
11:39.583 --> 11:41.883
I'll bring them both back.

155
11:43.706 --> 11:46.048
Be careful out there.

156
11:50.123 --> 11:52.913
Come on, everyone, line up.

157
11:52.913 --> 11:53.916
Thanks, man.

158
11:53.916 --> 11:55.081
Help yourselves. Take as much as you need.

159
11:55.081 --> 11:56.415
Come back if it's not enough.

160
11:56.415 --> 11:58.298
Help yourselves. Come on.

161
11:59.540 --> 12:01.333
You're just in time. It's dinner time.

162
12:01.333 --> 12:04.161
Xiao Xi, get two trays for them.

163
12:04.161 --> 12:06.248
Hey, no cutting in line.

164
12:06.248 --> 12:08.748
Go to the back of the line.

165
12:08.748 --> 12:11.331
No need. Dao, we're not here to eat.

166
12:11.331 --> 12:13.506
I have something to ask you.

167
12:14.792 --> 12:16.427
Go ahead.

168
12:16.427 --> 12:19.248
Grandma Qiu, who just arrived, was from our camp.

169
12:19.248 --> 12:21.833
She got separated from two others in the industrial area.

170
12:21.833 --> 12:23.758
We want to go look for them.

171
12:25.620 --> 12:27.545
The industrial area?

172
12:28.701 --> 12:30.829
There are a lot of zombies there.

173
12:30.829 --> 12:32.373
Are you sure you want to go?

174
12:32.373 --> 12:33.956
We have to go, no matter how dangerous.

175
12:33.956 --> 12:35.548
Yeah.

176
12:36.748 --> 12:38.042
Tell you what.

177
12:38.042 --> 12:40.248
I'll have Cheng and Kuan go with you.

178
12:40.248 --> 12:43.167
They know that area better.

179
12:43.167 --> 12:45.122
No need.

180
12:45.122 --> 12:46.415
You're still injured.

181
12:46.415 --> 12:48.715
Just lend us a car.

182
12:49.831 --> 12:51.881
Just like that? "Lend us a car"?

183
12:53.458 --> 12:56.717
We're not a charity here.

184
12:58.333 --> 13:01.341
Dao, we're very capable.

185
13:02.542 --> 13:04.040
I'm good at fixing electronics.

186
13:04.040 --> 13:08.290
Lie can stand guard or search for supplies.

187
13:08.290 --> 13:10.590
Please, lend us the car.

188
13:26.498 --> 13:28.340
Thank you, Dao.

189
14:19.456 --> 14:21.415
User's heart rate is consistently high.

190
14:21.415 --> 14:24.415
Shut up, shut up!

191
14:24.415 --> 14:27.456
Lie, was that you talking?

192
14:27.456 --> 14:29.048
No.

193
14:55.498 --> 14:57.090
Quick!

194
15:30.292 --> 15:32.967
Doesn't look like there are zombies here.

195
15:47.623 --> 15:48.623
What should we do?

196
15:48.623 --> 15:49.748
There are quite a few of them.

197
15:49.748 --> 15:51.298
Save your energy.

198
17:15.623 --> 17:18.590
Li, rest in peace.

199
17:21.956 --> 17:23.340
Lin Zai.
